This 0.8.0 package includes a controlled single-node production profile with
private HTTPS, JWT verification, local durable state, audit controls, and
verified backups. It does not provide high availability, an external identity
provider, or a model-serving sandbox. Dataset content and generated model
artifacts must be treated as untrusted input at every integration boundary.
